# crosslake -- Local Mode. Copy to .env if you want a file to source, but
# the Logfire token itself is NOT set here -- see docs/observability.md.
# `. scripts/logfire-env.sh` reads it from .logfire/logfire_credentials.json
# (created by `uvx logfire --region=us auth` + `projects use`) and exports
# LOGFIRE_TOKEN / OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_* for you.

# Optional: pin the AWS profile/region the poller and compare tool use.
# Defaults to your default AWS credential chain (SSO, env vars, etc.) if unset.
# AWS_PROFILE=
# AWS_REGION=us-east-1
